  "name": "MultiCamVideo-Dataset",
  "description": "Github \nProject Page \nPaper\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\ud83d\udcf7 MultiCamVideo Dataset\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t1. Dataset Introduction\n\t\n\nTL;DR: The MultiCamVideo Dataset, introduced in ReCamMaster, is a multi-camera synchronized video dataset rendered using Unreal Engine 5. It includes synchronized multi-camera videos and their corresponding camera trajectories. The MultiCamVideo Dataset can be valuable in fields such as camera-controlled video generation, synchronized video production, and 3D/4D reconstruction.\n\n  \n\n\nThe\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/KlingTeam/MultiCamVideo-Dataset.",
